00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:17.000
Just tell me!! Right now!!

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:19.880
Get my words, take my rights!

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:22.260
Unable to put up with this inescapable reality,

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:22.380
