close I am to having to repeat another year.

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:10.430
Morning!

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:10.970
Huh?

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:13.310
Uh, morning.

00:13:13.940 --> 00:13:15.810
The weather's fine again today!

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:18.060
Uh... Yeah...

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:20.780
Whaaat?!

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:24.110
Hey, morning!

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:27.070
Morning!

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:27.780
Mornin'!

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:29.080
Good morning!

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:35.540
