entity of dignity and class!

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:19.380
He's using glitter-decorated writing tools!

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:24.800
Look at all those glittery things
that Handa-kun would normally hate!

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:26.920
He's like some washed-up amateur model!

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:28.760
You're referring to me, aren't you?

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:30.050
I can't take it anymore!

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:32.850
My Handa aesthetic can't take any more of it!

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:35.140
All he did was make a commotion and leave!

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:39.600
I hope he gets mugged by all
the amateur models in the country.

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:41.060
What's up, guys?

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:43.400
What's with all the commotion?

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:44.070
Wha—?!

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:44.980
We're sorry!

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:48.150
You were talking about my
memory loss, weren't you?

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:49.780
Oh, so he does realize.

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:55.450
It's too bad I lost my memory,
but there's not much to be done about it.

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:59.580
Fortunately, I remembered
the most important thing.

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:00.960
Important thing?

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:01.460
Yes...

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:04.170
That I'm popular!

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:05.800
Ugh...

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:07.090
He's right, but...

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:08.510
...that was irritating.

00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:09.760
Now then...

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:15.770
Mr. Popular here better go and get
friendly with all the kitties in school!

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:19.600
That tension is going to continue forever?

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:21.900
Just thinking about that is making me gloomy.

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:24.020
Handa-san...

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:29.530
If that's how Handa-san is going to be,
there's no meaning in my coming to school!

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:30.610
I'm gonna drop out!

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:31.990
Don't cry, Tsuk-kun.

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:33.370
I'm here for you.

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:34.120
Die!

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:34.870
Harsh!

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:37.240
I don't think he should stay like that, either.

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:42.120
Now is the time for the Handa Force to come
together and force him back to his old self!

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:43.380
I'm with you!

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:46.460
Ah! Tsuk-kun!

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:51.090
Shoot! I'm late!

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:52.970
Huh?

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:54.930
Hey there, kitty.

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:57.850
Girls like this, right?

00:15:57.850 --> 00:15:59.560
Being romantically pinned against the wall?

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:00.850
I saw it on the Internet.

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:02.850
Handa-kun...!

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:05.150
I'm gonna slam my right hand, too!

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:08.280
Right-hand slam!

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:10.740
Now then, what should I slam with next?

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:13.110
There, a right-foot slam!

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:14.320
Great, right?!

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:16.530
This is something only Handa-kun can do!

00:16:16.530 --> 00:16:18.290
I don't give a damn about gravity!

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:20.580
Gross...!

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:21.870
Another weird fake running about.
Huh? Gross?

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:23.580
You're gross!
Another weird fake running about.

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:25.380
Poor Handa-kun...
Then how about...

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:26.040
Then how about...

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:31.260
Is it true that you're changing
your image as of today, Handa-kun?

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:33.760
So, us lowly citizens can speak with you now?

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:35.300
What about your "Handa Wall"?

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:37.220
Changing my image, nothing.

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:39.680
I was born to be popular, 'kay!

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:42.140
I always looked up to you!

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:43.640
A big thanks to you!

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:43.940
Can I touch you?
A big thanks to you!

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:44.900
Can I touch you?

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:46.360
Depends on where!

00:16:46.360 --> 00:16:47.270
Can I get your autograph?!

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:48.980
Do you have an autograph card and marker?

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:50.610
Now, get in line, everyone!

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:52.530
I'll kiss each one of you in order!

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:54.780
Silence

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:55.360
Huh? What?
Silence

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:55.870
Huh? What?

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:59.120
Guess we got another fake.

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:02.250
There's no way Handa-kun
would cheapen himself like that.

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:03.870
You ain't got the toughness in you!

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:05.250
Hey, everyone...

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:07.420
Huh? That's weird.

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:09.500
Isn't it normal for everyone to cry
tears of joy when an idol offers kisses?

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:13.220
Eauuugh!

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:18.850
Maybe my super popularity
isn't as big a deal as I thought.

00:17:23.230 --> 00:17:25.810
Is it true that you're offering kisses...?

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:28.690
Ah, this girl's bad news...

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:34.860
Huh... So that's why
Handa-kun's been acting strange.

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:35.910
Yup, yup.

00:17:35.910 --> 00:17:38.740
It's sad seeing him all excited
and boisterous like that.

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:39.620
Here it is!

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:41.450
To recover from memory loss,

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:45.370
the same level of shock which caused
the memory loss should be applied.

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:46.540
I see!

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:48.250
You're reading that like
some medical book, but...

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:49.000
Whoops,
I Lost My
Memory

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:50.130
...that's just a manga, right?

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:50.380
<b>Whoops,
I Lost My
Memory</b>

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:55.880
Handa-kun lost his memory
when he fell down the stairs, so...

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:58.640
He just needs to fall down the stairs again?!

00:17:58.640 --> 00:18:02.010
...for the same level of shock,
we'll just smack him with this.

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:03.810
Uh, I think that will kill him...

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:05.890
Don't follow me!

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:09.810
Handa-kun! Handa-kun!

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:11.520
Handa-kun! Kiss me!

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:14.360
Well, I guess some things
aren't different from before.

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:18.280
Somehow... got away...

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:20.240
Dang pathetic...

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:24.290
I can't believe a popular guy like me
is hiding in a lonely place like this.

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:27.960
Before I lost my memory, I was...

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:33.050
...surprisingly loved by everyone.

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:36.470
Sei-san, shouldn't you be in bed?

00:18:36.470 --> 00:18:37.840
Do you want to take some medicine?

00:18:37.840 --> 00:18:39.220
It's only cold medicine, though.

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:41.800
Seems like I was popular among
some of the shadier ones, too.

00:18:42.550 --> 00:18:45.520
I came to school without fear
despite my memory loss

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:48.980
because I thought my popularity would
make everyone accept me as I am now.

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:52.360
But then, why do I...

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:54.440
...feel so lonely?

00:18:55.860 --> 00:18:57.320
Silence

00:18:58.030 --> 00:18:58.570
Huh?

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:02.120
Why do I feel so good being here?

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:06.410
Why's my head suddenly...?!

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:11.630
What are you doing?!

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:13.000
I'm sorry, Handa-san!

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:16.130
I need the real you to be here.

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:18.380
He's carrying a blunt weapon!

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:19.470
What are you thinking?!

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:22.180
I'm supposed to be popular!

00:19:22.180 --> 00:19:23.180
Damn it!

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:25.850
I never expected a day to come
when I would hurt Handa-san!

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:28.930
Please kill me when you return to normal!

00:19:28.930 --> 00:19:31.850
Being popular must have made me
a target of jealousy and envy!

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:35.400
I don't want to die!

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:37.030
I don't want to die! I don't want to die!

00:19:37.030 --> 00:19:38.610
Ah! W-Wait up!

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:44.620
Scary... So scary!

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:46.830
I didn't expect anything like this!

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:48.500
There!

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:49.330
It's Handa-kun!

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:57.460
Everyone's my enemy!

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:59.420
Wasn't I popular?!

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:02.050
It's like everyone hates me!

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:05.890
What's with this headache...?!

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:09.020
You're not getting away, Handa!

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:13.190
We're not doing this because we hate you.

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:16.320
We just want you back to
your old self, Handa-kun.

00:20:16.320 --> 00:20:17.360
My head... My head feels like it's going to split!

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:18.860
All right, let's do this at once...
My head... My head feels like it's going to split!

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:20.190
All right, let's do this at once...

00:20:20.190 --> 00:20:28.990
Everyone hates me...
Everyone hates me... Everyone hates me...

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:30.450
Everyone hates me.

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:32.710
Wh-Where am I?

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:32.790
What am I...?

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:33.750
Ready...
What am I...?

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:34.250
Ready...

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:36.840
What the...?

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:39.800
I need to run!

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:46.430
Handa... kun...!

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:50.640
Handa-san...?

00:20:51.230 --> 00:20:52.730
That was one mean fall...

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:56.310
Ah, he's getting up.

00:20:56.900 --> 00:20:59.150
You think he's okay?

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:01.900
I never expected it to be this bad...

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:05.160
No... I knew it all along.

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:06.820
This just confirms it...

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:10.740
Everyone really hates me!

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:14.500
Not much I can do now but laugh.

00:21:17.840 --> 00:21:19.090
He left...

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:21.840
Did Handa-san get his memory back?

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:24.300
Yup, those eyes say it all.

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:25.300
He was smiling...

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:27.050
Student Council
Beware of falling down the stairs

00:21:27.050 --> 00:21:29.930
Our thoughts of Handa-kun brought him back!

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:35.600
Hey, y'all!

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:37.020
Morning!

00:21:37.480 --> 00:21:41.110
You're as irritating as ever, fake Handa.

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:46.570
Right? My Handa aesthetic needs to evolve
according to current trends, you know?

00:21:46.570 --> 00:21:48.990
Ah! Handa-kun, what's up?

00:21:57.790 --> 00:21:59.460
It's the usual Handa-san.

00:21:59.460 --> 00:22:00.920
He stared at him like he was trash.

00:22:00.920 --> 00:22:02.050
Thank goodness.

00:22:05.170 --> 00:22:07.550
And so, Handa safely
returned to his normal self.

00:22:17.960 --> 00:22:21.820
Don't look for me- Don't look for me-

00:22:21.820 --> 00:22:25.110
I'd rather not register in anyone's gaze,

00:22:25.110 --> 00:22:31.290
'Cause I'm still not settled into this world.

00:22:33.350 --> 00:22:37.170
Though I'm so transient, I've always said,

00:22:37.250 --> 00:22:42.420
"Someday, this unfair way of living will come back to bite me!"

00:22:42.460 --> 00:22:46.680
'Cause what I really want,

00:22:46.800 --> 00:22:50.390
Is to be laughing along with everyone else!

00:22:50.470 --> 00:22:54.350
My HIDE-AND-SEEK continues...

00:22:54.430 --> 00:22:58.610
My voice still can't make a sound,

00:23:00.850 --> 00:23:06.200
But I wonder if I can communicate this... all my thoughts and feelings!

00:23:06.200 --> 00:23:11.370
I can always hear it in the distance...

00:23:11.370 --> 00:23:19.040
And someday, I'd like to once again answer that call.

00:23:19.090 --> 00:23:22.250
The day when I'll be told, "It's alright, you've done all you can,"

00:23:22.250 --> 00:23:26.510
May be closer to arribing than I thought.

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:46.730
The stairs here are dangerous,
so let's put up a poster to warn others.

00:23:47.530 --> 00:23:49.360
Rikimaru, get it prepared immediately.

00:23:52.450 --> 00:23:53.070
Ah?

00:23:53.870 --> 00:23:56.200
I don't take orders from puny girls.

00:23:59.540 --> 00:24:00.620
Oh?!

00:24:05.380 --> 00:24:09.760
Next time, "Handa-kun and His Friend's Friend"
Handa-kun and two others. See you again!
